      ],
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 942,
          "quote": "A requirement-to-operation route\nalone does not discharge preservation or demonstrate fitness. A tenant cannot\nrepair an inconvenient requirement by silently changing the common `WHAT`.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation/codex/5a5b5ad80f0ba4b56b83aadd42ac130de53ba803/source/standards/SPEC_METHOD.md#Spec-Driven%20Homeostatic%20Methodology%2FSTDO%20Product%20Definition%20Overlay%20And%20Layout%20Independence%2FWHAT%2C%20HOW%2C%20And%20Work%20Carriers",
          "start_line": 940
        }
      ],
      "key": "realization_binding_obligations",
      "statement": "Each affected requirement identifies its realizing operation/invariant, interface preservation obligation and evidence capable of defeating realization. Binding preserves applicable authority, required human decisions, independence, failure and recovery conditions regardless of execution convenience. Context, time, memory, communication, human effort and spend state units and are measured at the declared material boundary. Context fit and attention adequacy retain distinct external evidence conditions; categorical preservation additionally invokes Orthogonal descriptions. A requirement-to-operation route alone proves neither preservation nor fitness. Author identity, actor identity and operation kind remain distinct; a person performing a procedure is not thereby adjudicating. An a_c representation neither chooses an executor nor proves realization conformance through structural validation. Tenants cannot silently alter common WHAT.",
      "uncertainty": "The cited FOUNDATIONS evidence and categorical-preservation contracts are not supplied."
    },
    {
